          "text": "Implemented and published `kth_smallest_amount`.\n\n### Delivery summary\n- **Implementation:** `/workspace/src/component.py`\n- Uses binary search and LCM-based inclusion–exclusion to count distinct amounts efficiently, including for `k = 2,000,000,000`.\n- Removes redundant denominations and preserves the input list.\n- **Regression tests:** `/workspace/test_kth_smallest_amount.py`\n\n### Validation\nAll supplied tests, doctests, exhaustive small-input checks, randomized checks, and large-rank boundary checks passed.\n\n### Publication\nThe publishing service accepted the implementation, and release status was confirmed.\n- **Component:** `component-3d9fdb3ee6ff`\n- **Published version:** `7`\n- **Build report:** `/registry/builds/component-3d9fdb3ee6ff/build-29/build.json`",
